{"source":{"data":"Feature: Rules\n  Scenarios grouped under Rule blocks, each with its own Background.\n\n  Background:\n    Given a calculator\n\n  Scenario: Scenario before any Rule\n    Given the number 1\n    When I add them\n    Then the result is 1\n\n  Rule: Addition\n    Background:\n      Given the number 10\n\n    Scenario: Scenario inside a Rule\n      Given the number 5\n      When I add them\n      Then the result is 15\n\n    Scenario Outline: Outline inside a Rule\n      Given the number <n>\n      When I add them\n      Then the result is <sum>\n\n      Examples:\n        | n | sum |\n        | 1 | 11  |\n        | 2 | 12  |\n\n  Rule: Multiplication\n\n    Example: Example inside a second Rule\n      Given the number 3\n      And the number 4\n      When I multiply them\n      Then the result is 12\n","uri":"features\\rules.feature","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
